 <tr><td>8</td><td>Assignment Audit</td><td>u_project_assignment</td><td>after insert/update/delete</td><td>500</td><td>Log changes via gs.info()</td></tr>
 </tbody>
 </table>

 <h2>4. Health Status Algorithm</h2>
 <pre><code>{`IF overdue (now > end_date AND completion < 100%):
 health = RED

ELSE IF variance > 25%:
 health = RED (critical delay)

ELSE IF variance > 10%:
 health = AMBER (slight delay)

ELSE:
 health = GREEN (on schedule)

WHERE:
 variance = expected% - actual%
 expected% = (elapsed_days / total_days) × 100`}</code></pre>

 <h2>5. Performance & Indexing</h2>
 <table>
 <thead><tr><th>Table</th><th>Indexed Fields</th><th>Query Pattern</th></tr></thead>
 <tbody>
