 <li>Automatic project numbering (PRJ0001, PRJ0002, ...)</li>
 <li>Six lifecycle states: Draft → Planned → In Progress → On Hold → Completed → Cancelled</li>
 <li>Three health indicators: Green (on track), Amber (slight delay), Red (critical delay)</li>
 <li>Budget tracking with decimal precision</li>
 <li>Auto-closure when completion reaches 100%</li>
 </ul>

 <h3>Assignment Management</h3>
 <ul>
 <li>Multiple assignees per project with individual roles</li>
 <li>Role definition: Lead, Developer, Analyst, Tester, Designer, Stakeholder, Consultant</li>
 <li>Allocation percentage tracking (0-100%)</li>
 <li>Auto-populated assignment metadata (date, assigned by)</li>
 <li>Reassignment with full audit trail</li>
 </ul>

 <h3>Task Management</h3>
 <ul>
 <li>Tasks with auto-numbering (PTSK00001, PTSK00002, ...)</li>
 <li>Task dependency tracking (self-referencing)</li>
 <li>Automatic rollup: task completion averages → project completion</li>
 <li>Auto-complete when task reaches 100%</li>
 </ul>

 <h2>2. User Personas</h2>
